      "message": "After discussion with Jean, we found that one non-obvious thing that will change if we call notifyInterfaceClassActivity simultaneously on two threads is that we can call reportNetworkActive on two threads. This is unsafe because reportNetworkActive does:\n\n        final int length \u003d mNetworkActivityListeners.beginBroadcast();\n\nand calling beginBroadcast twice before finishBroadcast will throw IllegalStateException. Even if this doesn\u0027t crash the system, it will result in the ConnectivityManager#addDefaultNetworkActiveListener public API misbehaving.",
